        "name": "Hope : The Flickering Light",
        "steam_appid": 3637640,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope: The Flickering Light</strong> is a thought-provoking puzzle game that challenges your logic, precision, and timing as you guide <i>Luna</i>, a determined girl from a village shrouded in darkness, in her search for the Eternal Flame — the only chance to break her homeland’s curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with only a candle and the echoes of her past failed attempts, Luna must navigate a shifting underground world filled with traps, layered puzzles, and dangerous patterns. Each flicker of light is more than a tool — it’s a symbol of determination, persistence, and the belief that even in the darkest places, something bright remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Challenging Logical Puzzles</strong><br>Every level is a carefully crafted brainteaser that tests your memory, sequencing, and timing skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Replayable Puzzle Design</strong><br>Experiment with different solutions to optimize your paths — perfection is earned, not given.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 <strong>Narrative-Driven Journey</strong><br>Uncover Luna’s story through minimalist storytelling, ambient clues, and layered symbolism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 <strong>Light as a Mechanic and Metaphor</strong><br>Use your candle to activate switches, reveal paths, and guide your echo — each flame represents hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ <strong>Echoes of the Past</strong><br>Your previous failed runs aren’t forgotten — they become allies, retracing your past and enabling puzzle layers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⌛ <strong>4–6 Hours of Focused Gameplay</strong><br>Designed for players who seek tightly designed challenges in a serene, meaningful world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Minimalist Aesthetic, Maximum Impact</strong><br>Inspired by games like <i>Journey</i> and <i>Inside</i>, Hope delivers rich emotion with elegant simplicity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a puzzle game that values brains over brute force, narrative over noise, and hope over despair — then light your candle, and begin your journey.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope: The Flickering Light</strong> is a thought-provoking puzzle game that challenges your logic, precision, and timing as you guide <i>Luna</i>, a determined girl from a village shrouded in darkness, in her search for the Eternal Flame — the only chance to break her homeland’s curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with only a candle and the echoes of her past failed attempts, Luna must navigate a shifting underground world filled with traps, layered puzzles, and dangerous patterns. Each flicker of light is more than a tool — it’s a symbol of determination, persistence, and the belief that even in the darkest places, something bright remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Challenging Logical Puzzles</strong><br>Every level is a carefully crafted brainteaser that tests your memory, sequencing, and timing skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Replayable Puzzle Design</strong><br>Experiment with different solutions to optimize your paths — perfection is earned, not given.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 <strong>Narrative-Driven Journey</strong><br>Uncover Luna’s story through minimalist storytelling, ambient clues, and layered symbolism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 <strong>Light as a Mechanic and Metaphor</strong><br>Use your candle to activate switches, reveal paths, and guide your echo — each flame represents hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ <strong>Echoes of the Past</strong><br>Your previous failed runs aren’t forgotten — they become allies, retracing your past and enabling puzzle layers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⌛ <strong>4–6 Hours of Focused Gameplay</strong><br>Designed for players who seek tightly designed challenges in a serene, meaningful world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Minimalist Aesthetic, Maximum Impact</strong><br>Inspired by games like <i>Journey</i> and <i>Inside</i>, Hope delivers rich emotion with elegant simplicity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a puzzle game that values brains over brute force, narrative over noise, and hope over despair — then light your candle, and begin your journey.</p>",
        "short_description": "A logical puzzle game where timing and planning matter. Guide Luna through a cursed labyrinth using candlelight and echoes of past attempts to reach the Eternal Flame. Solve layered challenges and uncover meaning in every flicker of hope.",
